flowchart LR
    CLIENT[SPA o app movil]
    WAF[AWS WAF]
    GATE[API Gateway]
    BFF[BFF web]
    AUTH[Validacion JWT y scopes]
    DOMAIN[Servicios de dominio: cliente movimientos transferencias onboarding]
    DATA[Repositorios: SQLite MVP RDS objetivo]
    OUTBOX[Outbox y relay]
    BUS[EventBridge y SQS DLQ]
    WORKER[Worker transferencias]
    AUDIT[Consumidor auditoria a S3 Object Lock]
    NOTICE[Consumidor notificaciones]
    PROVIDERS[Core pagos Cognito biometria correo push]
    CLIENT -->|TLS HTTPS JSON| WAF
    WAF -->|TLS| GATE
    GATE -->|VPC Link privado| BFF
    GATE -->|VPC Link privado| AUTH
    BFF -->|sesion segura CSRF| AUTH
    AUTH -->|JWT issuer audience sub scope ACR AMR| DOMAIN
    DOMAIN -->|SQL parametrizado TLS| DATA
    DOMAIN -->|OIDC OAuth2 TLS| PROVIDERS
    DATA -->|misma transaccion| OUTBOX
    OUTBOX -->|evento TLS IAM minimo privilegio| BUS
    BUS -->|reintentos DLQ| WORKER
    BUS -->|cola dedicada| AUDIT
    BUS -->|cola dedicada| NOTICE
    WORKER -->|idempotencia API autenticada| PROVIDERS
